      "sourceHash": "b850922985ae507f",
      "translationZh": "我在 Qwen 3.8 27B FP8 上运行了 Aider 基准测试，使用 vLLM、FP8 KV 缓存和 256K 上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16af0fadd185e57b",
      "translationZh": "这个成绩与 2025-04-12 的 Gemini 2.5 Pro 持平，后者也得了 72.9 分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b2d5cf29cbd8024",
      "translationZh": "超过了 2025-05-25 的 Claude Opus 4，后者得了 72.0 分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "767fe378f05e4e67",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek R1 2025-06-06 得了 71.4 分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2f5fc1b239c18ab",
      "translationZh": "这或许只是一个随手选的基准测试，而且还是个老测试，但我的 MacBook 如今竟然能与那些仅仅一年多前的 SOTA 模型打成平手，依然让人惊叹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f9f906a7f9cef0c",
      "translationZh": "在实际表现上，它也远远超过了它们，因为 harness 变得更好了。我一直在试用 DeepSeek Harness，它显然能解决大多数、甚至 100% 的 Aider 测试，只不过会用到超过 2 轮交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efddabc6a8de00ba",
      "translationZh": "编辑补充：使用 BF16 且不对 KV 缓存进行量化时，Qwen 3.8 27B 得了 75.1 分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
